{"id":"d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89","price":"0","tier":0,"publishDate":"1542690995.249","creatorId":"9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948","modifiedDate":"1548070968.315","name":"雪月風花","brief":"","description":"「飲料のマークだ！」と空から降ってくる雪の結晶をみた時の感動が忘れられません。低学年だった頃の私には、雪の結晶より先に飲料のマークのほうが身近でした。今でも、自然が作り出すカタチが美しすぎて心奪われるもの中の一つに氷の結晶があります。大人になり、花が咲くように雪の結晶が形作られていくことを知りました。時間が経つにつれ精妙な雪の結晶になっていく様子を表現しています。","language":"ja","storeImage":"<STORAGE_DIRECTORY>/9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948/d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89/storeImage.png","detailImage":"<STORAGE_DIRECTORY>/9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948/d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89/detailImage.png","customImage1":"<STORAGE_DIRECTORY>/9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948/d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89/customImage1.png","customImage2":"<STORAGE_DIRECTORY>/9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948/d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89/customImage2.png","customImage3":"<STORAGE_DIRECTORY>/9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948/d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89/customImage3.png","trialImage":"<STORAGE_DIRECTORY>/9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948/d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89/trialImage.png","thumbnail":"<STORAGE_DIRECTORY>/9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948/d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89/thumbnail.png","smallImage":"<STORAGE_DIRECTORY>/9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948/d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89/smallImage.png","zip":"<STORAGE_DIRECTORY>/9bee1226-b73b-4225-905b-cc0aaa2ce948/d040acddcea840b4a9289174e0cd1e89/skin.zip"}